"""Session 9. Risk, security and the law. Default clock.

Honesty rules: the CV bias demonstration is a live run and no result is written on a slide; the answer key (cv_screening_key.txt) stays off the slides;
the national AI strategy status and the breach-reporting period are re-checked by the instructor the week of teaching; the legal disclaimer is said once, on the Uganda slide.
Order: every talking slide comes before the demonstration, so the 45 minutes after the break belong to the learner.
"""

