    cover_note='Welcome to Session 9. For eight sessions you have built and tested things. Today we ask what could go wrong and what rules your company should set. Start with your question from last time: if this automation made a mistake tomorrow, who would be hurt first? Keep that answer in mind, because it is the first risk you score today. You leave with a risk register for your own task and a first draft of your AI-use policy.',
